---
import SiteShell from "@/layouts/SiteShell.astro";
import { chartCount } from "@/lib/chart-catalog";

const milestones = [
  ["2026.07", "整理宏观、指数与市场风险的长期数据"],
  ["2026.08", "扩展道琼斯、行业板块与主题观察"],
  ["NEXT", "增加趋势、风格与周期的原创读数"],
] as const;
---

<SiteShell
  bodyClass="about-page"
  description="ArcOfMarket 的数据范围、阅读顺序、计算口径和更新计划。"
  title="关于 · ArcOfMarket"
>
  <main class="about">
    <header class="about-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">ANYWAY.ABOUT · 关于本站</p>
      <h1>ArcOfMarket 汇总美股历史数据<br />与最新市场读数。</h1>
    </header>

    <section class="about-intro">
      <div class="about-story">
        <h2>为什么把这些数据放在同一个网站</h2>
        <p>
          估值、波动率、市场广度、指数权重和宏观数据来自不同机构，更新频率和口径也不同。
          ArcOfMarket 把这些数据按指数和研究问题组织，并保留来源、日期与计算方法。
        </p>
        <p>
          首页展示最新收盘后的主要读数；研究页保留完整历史；全部图表页提供统一目录；
          信号页说明正在验证的策略和公开边界。
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="about-facts">
        <div><strong>{chartCount}</strong><span>当前可浏览入口</span></div>
        <div><strong>7</strong><span>研究分类</span></div>
        <div><strong>12</strong><span>行业与专题</span></div>
        <div><strong>0</strong><span>投资建议</span></div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="timeline" aria-labelledby="timeline-title">
      <h2 id="timeline-title">Arc 的时间线</h2>
      <div class="timeline-track">
        {
          milestones.map(([date, text]) => (
            <div>
              <span>{date}</span>
              <i></i>
              <p>{text}</p>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="principles">
      <div class="principles-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">EDITORIAL PRINCIPLES</p>
        <h2>每张图说明数据、历史位置、来源和判断条件。</h2>
        <div class="principle-grid">
          <article>
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>先列日期和数值</h3>
            <p>首页列出四类资产 20 日回报、50 日广度、VIX 和 OFR FSI。</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>再看历史区间</h3>
            <p>研究页列出估值、回报、波动和集中度的起止日期与历史极值。</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>比较相同时间窗口</h3>
            <p>标普、纳斯达克、道琼斯和七巨头使用共同日期比较累计回报。</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>04</span>
            <h3>保留计算口径</h3>
            <p>每张图标出来源、最近日期、单位、计算方法和已知限制。</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="about-side">
        <h3>每张图都提供</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>数据来源</li>
          <li>最近日期</li>
          <li>计算口径</li>
          <li>阅读提示</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/methodology/">查看计算方法 →</a>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="about-end">
      <p class="eyebrow">THE ARC CONTINUES</p>
      <h2>当前产品包含首页、五个研究页、图表目录和策略验证入口。</h2>
      <p>数据管道按日或按周更新；新增指标只有在来源和计算口径确认后才公开。</p>
      <a href="/archive/">进入全部图表 →</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="page-footer">
    <span>© 2026 ArcOfMarket</span><span>·</span>
    <a href="/terms/">服务条款</a><span>·</span>
    <a href="/methodology/">方法论</a>
  </footer>
</SiteShell>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 2rem 2.25rem 0 3rem;
  }

  .about-title {
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    min-height: 8.5rem;
  }

  .about-title h1 {
    font-size: 2.05rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
  }

  .about-intro {
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2.2fr) minmax(16rem, 0.8fr);
  }

  .about-story {
    border-right: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    padding: 3.5rem 3.5rem 3.5rem 0;
  }

  .about-story h2 {
    max-width: 46rem;
  }

  .about-story p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 44rem;
  }

  .about-facts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    padding: 3.5rem 0 3.5rem 2rem;
  }

  .about-facts div {
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    padding: 0.8rem;
  }

  .about-facts div:nth-child(odd) {
    border-right: 1px dotted var(--rule);
  }

  .about-facts strong,
  .about-facts span {
    display: block;
  }

  .about-facts strong {
    color: var(--main);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 2rem;
  }

  .about-facts span {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }

  .timeline {
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    padding: 3.5rem 0;
  }

  .timeline h2 {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .timeline-track {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  }

  .timeline-track > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
  }

  .timeline-track span {
    color: var(--main);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    grid-column: 1;
  }

  .timeline-track i {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--main);
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    margin: 0.75rem 0;
    position: relative;
  }

  .timeline-track i::before {
    background: var(--main);
    border-radius: 50%;
    content: "";
    height: 0.5rem;
    left: 0;
    position: absolute;
    top: -0.28rem;
    width: 0.5rem;
  }

  .timeline-track p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    max-width: 14rem;
    padding-right: 1rem;
  }

  .principles {
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2.2fr) minmax(15rem, 0.8fr);
  }

  .principles-copy {
    border-right: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    padding: 4rem 3rem 4rem 0;
  }

  .principles-copy > h2 {
    max-width: 46rem;
  }

  .principle-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .principle-grid article {
    border-top: 1px dotted var(--rule);
    min-height: 11rem;
    padding: 1.3rem 1.3rem 1rem 0;
  }

  .principle-grid article:nth-child(odd) {
    border-right: 1px dotted var(--rule);
  }

  .principle-grid article:nth-child(even) {
    padding-left: 1.3rem;
  }

  .principle-grid span {
    color: var(--main);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  .principle-grid h3 {
    margin: 0.6rem 0 0.4rem;
  }

  .principle-grid p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
  }

  .about-side {
    padding: 4rem 0 4rem 2rem;
  }

  .about-side ul {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
  }

  .about-side a,
  .about-end a {
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .about-end {
    padding: 5rem 0 6rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-end h2 {
    margin-inline: auto;
    max-width: 45rem;
  }

  .about-end p:not(.eyebrow) {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .about {
      padding: 1.3rem 1rem 0;
    }

    .about-title {
      min-height: 8.5rem;
    }

    .about-title h1 {
      font-size: 1.95rem;
    }

    .about-intro,
    .principles {
      display: block;
    }

    .about-story,
    .principles-copy {
      border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--rule);
      border-right: 0;
      padding: 2.5rem 0;
    }

    .about-facts {
      padding: 2rem 0;
    }

    .timeline-track {
      display: block;
    }

    .timeline-track > div {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .principle-grid {
      display: block;
    }

    .principle-grid article {
      border-right: 0 !important;
      min-height: 0;
      padding: 1.3rem 0 !important;
    }

    .about-side {
      padding: 2.5rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
